=== intro

One of the crew approaches, hesitant. "Captain. We've been running hard. The crew's been talking. Not complaining—just... it's been a while since we had shore leave. Real shore leave."

They're not wrong. The void wears people down. A little rest might do everyone good.

* [Grant shore leave (20 credits)]
  ~ credits -= 20
  ~ morale += 15
  ~ chronicle "Shore Leave"
    Gave the crew shore leave. Credits spent on drinks and diversions. Morale returned with interest.
  -> END

* [A meal, at least (10 credits)]
  ~ credits -= 10
  ~ morale += 8
  ~ chronicle "Crew Meal"
    Treated the crew to a real meal. Not shore leave, but appreciated nonetheless.
  -> END

* [We can't afford to stop]
  ~ morale -= 5
  ~ chronicle "No Rest"
    Denied the crew's request for shore leave. The work continues. The void doesn't wait.
  -> END
